{"step_index":223,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T18:44:05Z","thinking":"**Adding modern form styles**\n\nDesigning CSS rules for modern forms, inputs, and textboxes within the `style.css` file. Starting with the `.form-group` class to establish the foundational structure for form elements, using margin, position, and flexbox for layout. Defining `.form-label` styles to enhance visual appeal, including font size, weight, color, margin, and letter-spacing for improved readability.\n\n\n**Refining Input Field Styles**\n\nEvaluating the CSS for input field components. Focused on ensuring consistent styling across different input types.  Added classes for left icons and right actions on inputs. Considering hover and focus states for improved usability.\n\n\n**Implementing input field enhancements**\n\nRefining input field focus and hover states to provide visual feedback. Addressing Chrome/Safari/Edge autofill styling inconsistencies. Further styling the search button within input groups to ensure visual consistency.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Make input controls, form groups, and textboxes modern and presentable","EndLine":332,"Instruction":"Replace lines 287 to 332 in style.css with modern input controls, form groups, and presentable textbox styling","ReplacementContent":"/* Forms, Inputs & Textboxes */\n.form-group {\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.form-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1e293b;\n    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n.form-label .required-star {\n    color: var(--danger);\n    margin-left: 2px;\n}\n\n.input-group {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    width: 100%;\n    align-items: stretch;\n}\n\n.input-wrapper {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n\n.input-icon-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 1rem;\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    transition: color 0.2s ease;\n    z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.input-action-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0.75rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n    z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.input-action-right:hover {\n    color: #1e293b;\n    background: #f1f5f9;\n}\n\n.input-control {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    min-width: 0;\n    display: block;\n    height: 48px;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n    outline: none;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.input-wrapper .input-control.has-icon-left {\n    padding-left: 2.85rem;\n}\n\n.input-wrapper .input-control.has-action-right {\n    padding-right: 2.85rem;\n}\n\n.input-control::placeholder {\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    font-weight: 400;\n}\n\n.input-control:hover {\n    border-color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.input-control:focus {\n    border-color: #2563eb;\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12), 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n}\n\n.input-wrapper:focus-within .input-icon-left {\n    color: #2563eb;\n}\n\n/* Chrome / Safari / Edge Autofill Fix */\ninput:-webkit-autofill,\ninput:-webkit-autofill:hover, \ninput:-webkit-autofill:focus, \ninput:-webkit-autofill:active {\n    -webkit-box-shadow: 0 0 0 50px #ffffff inset !important;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: #0f172a !important;\n    border-color: #94a3b8 !important;\n    transition: background-color 5000s ease-in-out 0s;\n}\n\n.input-group .input-control {\n    flex: 1;\n    height: 52px;\n}\n\n.input-group .btn-search {\n    height: 52px;\n    padding: 0 1.75rem;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);\n    color: white;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25), 0 1px 2px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #1e40af 100%);\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35), 0 2px 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:active {\n    transform: translateY(0);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);\n}","StartLine":287,"TargetContent":".input-group {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.input-control {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;\n    border: 2px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n    background: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.input-control:focus {\n    border-color: var(--primary);\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: var(--primary-gradient);\n    color: white;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);\n}","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\qualification-verification-system\\src\\main\\resources\\static\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Update form styles in style.css","toolSummary":"Update input-control, form-group, and button styling"}}]}
