{"step_index":226,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T18:44:33Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T20:44:33+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T20:44:34+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/resources/templates/login.html`\nTotal Lines: 117\nTotal Bytes: 8376\nShowing lines 1 to 117\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: <!DOCTYPE html>\n2: <html lang=\"en\">\n3: <head>\n4:     <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n5:     <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n6:     <title>Officer Authentication | QVS</title>\n7:     <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/style.css?v=skyblue\">\n8: </head>\n9: <body>\n10: \n11:     <nav class=\"navbar\">\n12:         <div class=\"nav-container\">\n13:             <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav-brand\">\n14:                 <div class=\"brand-logo\">🎓</div>\n15:                 <div class=\"brand-text\">\n16:                     <span class=\"brand-title\">DevOps QVS</span>\n17:                     <span class=\"brand-subtitle\">Authentication Portal</span>\n18:                 </div>\n19:             </a>\n20:             <div class=\"nav-links\">\n21:                 <a href=\"/dashboard?tab=verifyTab\" class=\"nav-link\">Verify Credential 🔒</a>\n22:                 <a href=\"/dashboard\" class=\"nav-link\">Institution Portal</a>\n23:                 <a href=\"/audit\" class=\"nav-link\">Audit Trail</a>\n24:             </div>\n25:         </div>\n26:     </nav>\n27: \n28:     <main style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\">\n29:         <div class=\"search-card\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\">\n30:             <h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #0f172a;\">Authorized Portal Login</h1>\n31:             <p style=\"color: #64748b; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n32:                 Sign in with your accredited Verifier, Institution Officer, or Administrator account.\n33:             </p>\n34: \n35:             <div id=\"noticeBanner\" style=\"display: none; background: #eff6ff; color: #1e40af; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; padding: 0.85rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.4;\">\n36:                 🔒 <strong>Verification Access Restricted:</strong> Credential verification is only accessible after an authorized user logs into the system.\n37:             </div>\n38: \n39:             <div id=\"loginError\" style=\"display: none; background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;\"></div>\n40: \n41:             <form onsubmit=\"handleLogin(event)\">\n42:                 <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n43:                     <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">Username</label>\n44:                     <input type=\"text\" id=\"username\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"Enter username\" required autofocus>\n45:                 </div>\n46:                 <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n47:                     <label style=\"display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">Password</label>\n48:                     <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" class=\"input-control\" placeholder=\"Enter password\" required>\n49:                 </div>\n50:                 <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Sign In & Access Portal</button>\n51:             </form>\n52: \n53:             <div style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #475569;\">\n54:                 <p style=\"font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: #1e293b; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n55:                     <span>Demo Accounts & Role Access Matrix:</span>\n56:                     <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: normal;\">(Click to auto-fill)</span>\n57:                 </p>\n58: \n59:                 <!-- Verifier Role -->\n60:                 <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">\n61:                     <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-btn chip-success\" style=\"text-align: left; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('username').value='verifier';document.getElementById('password').value='Verifier@12345';\">\n62:                         <span>🔍 <strong>Accredited Verifier</strong> (Employer / Background Checker)</span>\n63:                         <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">verifier</span>\n64:                     </button>\n65:                     <div style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #475569; padding-left: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;\">\n66:                         <span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">✓ Can Access:</span> Credential Verification Console, Blockchain Explorer, AI Anomaly Scanner.<br>\n67:                         <span style=\"color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600;\">✕ No Access:</span> Cannot Issue Credentials, Cannot Revoke, Cannot Browse Qualifications Registry.\n68:                     </div>\n69:                 </div>\n70: \n71:                 <!-- Officer Role -->\n72:                 <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px