{"step_index":231,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T18:44:59Z","thinking":"**Unifying Existing CSS Styles**\n\nExamining the `style.css` file reveals a duplicate definition for `.form-label`. Aims to unify these declarations for clarity and maintainability within the CSS file.\n\nNow, focusing on the `.auth-container`, styles must be added to ensure proper layout and responsiveness across different viewports. Specifically, configuring flexbox for centering and padding, setting a minimum height to ensure consistent visual presentation.\n\n\n**Applying Specific CSS Styles**\n\nAnalyzing the provided CSS, specific styles are now being applied to key elements. Focused on styling the `.auth-card`, `.auth-icon-badge`, `.auth-title`, `.auth-subtitle`, `.demo-matrix-box`, `.demo-matrix-header`, and `.demo-item` to match the given design. These styles will establish the visual appearance of the authentication components and demo elements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add auth-card, auth-badge, and demo-matrix styles to style.css","EndLine":1260,"Instruction":"Refine form-label and add auth-card, demo-matrix, and modern form styles","ReplacementContent":".form-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #334155;\n    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n/* Auth Page & Form Presentation */\n.auth-page-wrapper {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;\n    min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, #eff6ff 0%, #f8fafc 55%, #f1f5f9 100%);\n}\n\n.auth-card {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 520px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 0 0 1px rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.6);\n    padding: 2.5rem;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.auth-icon-badge {\n    width: 56px;\n    height: 56px;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12) 0%, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.12) 100%);\n    border: 1.5px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);\n    font-size: 1.85rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);\n}\n\n.auth-title {\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n}\n\n.auth-subtitle {\n    color: #64748b;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.demo-matrix-box {\n    margin-top: 1.75rem;\n    background: #f8fafc;\n    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.demo-matrix-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 0.825rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1e293b;\n    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n.demo-item {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.demo-item:hover {\n    border-color: #cbd5e1;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n}\n\n.demo-fill-btn {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: left;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1e293b;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.role-tag {\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #eff6ff;\n    color: #1d4ed8;\n    border: 1px solid #dbeafe;\n}\n\n.role-tag-verifier {\n    background: #ecfdf5;\n    color: #047857;\n    border-color: #a7f3d0;\n}\n\n.role-tag-officer {\n    background: #eff6ff;\n    color: #1d4ed8;\n    border-color: #bfdbfe;\n}\n\n.role-tag-admin {\n    background: #f5f3ff;\n    color: #6d28d9;\n    border-color: #ddd6fe;\n}","StartLine":1245,"TargetContent":".form-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #334155;\n    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\qualification-verification-system\\src\\main\\resources\\static\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Update style.css","toolSummary":"Add auth card and demo matrix styles"}}]}
